1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:07,000
The wall top is the only place that
sees the whole city. Ninety-two steps.
I count every one. Out for four. In
for two.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:13,300
From up there, I finally see where
everybody went. Past the south gate,
in the long grass. A field.

3
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:20,367
Eleven thousand people, standing in
rows. In their pajamas. Barefoot. All
facing the old exchange on the hill.

4
00:00:20,867 --> 00:00:27,667
Nobody waves. Nobody turns around.
Eleven thousand people, and not one of
them looks back at the wall.
